  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">Cami Crackled Metallic Leather Platform Sandal by Michael Kors. Designed with superior craftsmanship and luxury finishing.</p>\n  <div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin: 15px 0;\">\n    <h4 style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\">\n      <li><strong>Material:</strong> 100% of the leather in this product comes from tanneries receiving Leather Working Group Gold- or Silver-certification in recognition of their environmental performance., Metallic leather</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> polyurethane blend</li>\n      <li><strong>Silhouette:</strong> Open toe</li>\n      <li><strong>Closure:</strong> Buckle fastening</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">Michael Kors Women's Shoe Size Guide</summary>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; text-align: left; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <thead><tr style=\"background: #f8f8f8;\"><th style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">US Size</th><th style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">UK Size</th><th style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">EU Size</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">US 5</td><td style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">UK 3</td><td style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">EU 35.5</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">US 5.5</td><td style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">UK 3.5</td><td style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">EU 36</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">US 6</td><td style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">UK 4</td><td style=\"padding: 8px; border: